    "The initial new validator attempted to release a prepared constant |1> without undoing preparation. The engine rejected it. Corrected disposal is unitary and checked for phases and absence of channels.",
    "An initial audit assumed normal/sanitized QASM identity. GCC can fold x-1 to x+(-1) only in the ordinary frontend; both distinct circuits were subsequently verified, including labeled basis paths."
